Package: com.codex.flymemultitasking
Name: Flyme Multitasking - 0.9.70 Physical Coordinate Unification
Description: Puts every landscape overlay window (wheel, floating card, dock gate) into the same physical display coordinate space so the card stops rendering as a rotated portrait window on a landscape display, bridges wheel item centres through UIScreen.coordinateSpace and re-syncs them after layout, converts portrait-space keyboard frames instead of discarding them, routes the remote keyboard Scene through FBScene mutable settings, and stops publishing a saturated keyboard avoidance to the target App.
Maintainer: Codex build for local testing
Author: Codex build for local testing
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000), preferenceloader
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Version: 0.9.70
